Package: wiim-home-linux
Version: 0.2.10.4-1
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: WiiM Home Linux Community <noreply@localhost>
Depends: bash, python3, p7zip-full | 7zip, qt6-base-dev-tools, ca-certificates
Recommends: uv, libgl1, libegl1, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb-cursor0
Description: Native Linux converter and launcher for WiiM Home
 Converts a user-supplied official WiiM Home macOS x86_64 DMG into a
 local Linux runtime. The proprietary application is not included.
 A network connection and uv Python package manager are needed for setup.
